# ============================================
# 📋 QUICK CHECKLIST
# ============================================
# Before deploying, make sure you have:
# ✅ Replaced all API keys with real values
# ✅ Generated strong passwords for POSTGRES_PASSWORD, JWT_SECRET, SESSION_SECRET
# ✅ Changed ADMIN_PASSWORD to something secure
# ✅ Set correct CHATWOOT_URL, TOKEN, ACCOUNT_ID, and INBOX_ID
# ✅ Configured your domain in Coolify (e.g., ai-agent.astralsup.com)
# ✅ Enabled SSL/HTTPS in Coolify

# ============================================
# 🔗 WHERE TO GET API KEYS
# ============================================
# Anthropic Claude: https://console.anthropic.com/
# OpenAI (Whisper): https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# ElevenLabs: https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
# Chatwoot Token: Settings → Integrations → API → Access Token

# ============================================
# 🎯 AFTER DEPLOYMENT
# ============================================
# Configure Chatwoot webhook to point to:
# https://YOUR-DOMAIN.com/webhook/chatwoot
#
# Access admin dashboard at:
# https://YOUR-DOMAIN.com/admin/dashboard
#
# Test health endpoint:
# https://YOUR-DOMAIN.com/health
